  "_comment": [
    "Mike Schmidt Memorial Iron Team Award winners.",
    "",
    "The award goes to the team with the highest cumulative score across the three",
    "North American Baja SAE events in a season. It is named for Mike Schmidt, a",
    "founding member of the revived RIT Baja team, who was killed in a car accident",
    "in 2001; it has been awarded since that year and is partially sponsored by RIT.",
    "",
    "SAE does not publish a machine-readable list of past winners, and its own award",
    "pages were not reachable when this was compiled, so entries come from",
    "third-party sources (university news, team sites) and each carries an explicit",
    "confidence. Anything not 'confirmed' is rendered with a caveat in the UI and is",
    "never presented as established fact.",
    "",
    "From 2016 onward the site also computes a season champion from the official",
    "archive. Where the two disagree, the History page shows both rather than",
    "silently preferring one.",
    "",
    "Corrections are welcome: open an issue or a PR against this file."
  ],
